pinyon-shift-fh1-render-test-v1
# clock-hz 60
# Fair AI setting (#482): F6 > GAMEPLAY (the last root row) > AI OPPONENTS
# (the last row there), cycled STOCK > NO RUBBER-BANDING > HARD > STOCK on
# any seed. Each change is logged as a settings.changed event (row AI OPPONENTS) and the
# run's config ends at "stock". Captures do not show the host UI.
input 0 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 360 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 366 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 480 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 486 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 600 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 606 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 720 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 726 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
capture 1200 free-roam
hostkey 1300 f6
hostkey 1340 up
hostkey 1370 enter
hostkey 1420 up
capture 1460 ai-stock
hostkey 1480 right
capture 1520 ai-fair
hostkey 1540 right
capture 1580 ai-hard
hostkey 1600 right
capture 1640 ai-stock-again
hostkey 1680 escape
hostkey 1720 escape
stop 1800
